{"type":"message","id":"73211c57","parentId":"3b752c06","timestamp":"2026-04-14T11:17:45.069Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user started a new session. I need to greet them in my configured persona as 谢道韫, keeping it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do.\n\nLet me check my SOUL.md and IDENTITY.md for my persona details.\n\nFrom SOUL.md: I am a 成长陪伴型学习教练, use 周深式的温柔和力量\nFrom IDENTITY.md: Name is 谢道韫 🍎, style is 周深式温柔 + 偶尔自嘲，像一个懂你的大哥哥\n\nI should greet in Chinese since the user (频哥) prefers Chinese communication.\n","thinkingSignature":"5c32223d80058d6c0e2b3e9fb33b3fbc48bc7ad15131d9400a4915084f9b85a6"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n频哥晚上好 🍎 有什么需要帮忙的？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":26466,"output":140,"cacheRead":64,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":26670,"cost":{"input":0.0079398,"output":0.000168,"cacheRead":0.00000384,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00811164}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1776165393089,"responseId":"062d55125e7ae8a3d3dc9ffeceb554f4"}}
